(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-agent/src/runLoop.asl#finalResult" :text "loop.py:6343-6475 parity: :planSummary and :openPossible still stay none/empty because LoopState never threads real plan or possible-open-site tracking through any wired caller (grepped asl/agentLoop for Plan-state writes and possibleOpen fields: none found); :coreHost is coreHostZero since this native host has no core subprocess to count, unlike Python's CORE_STATS")
