(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-agent/tests/parity.asl#" :text "Replays a U6 parity fixture (tests/parity/agentLoop/parityLib.py): each (:case :id :fn :args :out) line is decoded, the dispatch runs the port on the args and returns the canonical serialisation of its result, and one assert per case compares it with :out. Canonical form: nil true false ints \"strings\" (over 4096 bytes: (h bytes \"sha256\")) (l ...) (d (\"key\" v) ...) sorted by key; args may use (rep s n), (seq p a b) for lines p<a>..p<b-1>, and (cat a b ...).")
