(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-agent/src/journal.asl#" :text "Leon's system prompt, harness layers, journal and hand-back, ported from scripts/agentLoop/loop.py 6619-end (parity: asl/packages/asl-agent/tests/journalParityTest.asl against tests/parity/agentLoop/journalParityGen.py). The module-level _WRITTEN dict is the Written value passed in and returned. Errors carry the Python exception they stand for as \"Type: message\". harnessLayers renders launch.render for the leon client from repoRoot/asl/grammar (harness.asn, clients.asn, tools.asn) with the launch.py ASN reader (asnRead). git, chmod, uname and date run as argv through asl-proc exec!. Strings are bytes: Python's Unicode isspace and \\w are ASCII here, and error byte offsets count bytes.")
